## Example local.properties
## Android Studio will automatically generate this file with your own SDK path when you open the project.
## If building manually from command line, specify your Android SDK location below:
##
## Windows Example:
# sdk.dir=C\:\\Users\\YourUsername\\AppData\\Local\\Android\\Sdk
##
## Mac Example:
# sdk.dir=/Users/YourUsername/Library/Android/sdk
##
## Linux Example:
# sdk.dir=/home/YourUsername/Android/Sdk
